        {
          "id": "l15",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "But trace the curved beam back, and the real Sun is already *below* the horizon.",
          "pauseAfterMs": 600
        },
        {
          "id": "l16",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "The air lifts the picture of the Sun by about its own *width*.",
          "pauseAfterMs": 500
        },
        {
          "id": "l17",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "So the Sun on your screen has, in a way, already *set*.",
          "pauseAfterMs": 900
